---
const faqs = [
  { question: "Does Orso store my content in a separate CMS database?", answer: "No. For configured Astro content collections, Orso edits the Markdown files in your site project." },
  { question: "Can I change more than blog posts?", answer: "Yes. The Content tab edits supported collections, and the agent can help change the site's copy, components, styles, and code." },
  { question: "Can I use an existing site?", answer: "You can open a project from GitHub. To edit Astro content collections in the CMS, the project needs the Orso Astro integration and supported collection loaders." },
  { question: "How does publishing work?", answer: "For a GitHub-backed site, Orso lets you make a change, share a preview, and publish through the repository's existing workflow. Your site's hosting and deployment remain your choice." },
];
---

<section class="border-t border-section-line" id="faq">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-section sm:px-8 sm:py-section-wide lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-6 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-accent">04 / A few more details</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Frequently<br /><span class="text-brand-muted">asked questions.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">How content, code, and publishing work together in Orso.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-section-line">
      {faqs.map((item) => (
        <details class="group border-b border-section-line py-6">
          <summary class="flex min-h-11 touch-manipulation cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 rounded-sm font-medium leading-relaxed transition-colors hover:text-brand-accent focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-brand-accent group-open:text-brand-accent [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            {item.question}
            <svg aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-open:rotate-45 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:group-open:rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 pr-8 leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">{item.answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
